GGG-xcf4YsvDC5Xqsbs1NnYB6Qx_hVRVYWDNlDJ3E4_YlySjNKW4J5f6X8lotE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOxQ-9nPjg2mWAvCUj94dr1utP3PLSgMU4KB7BctNeVKg&oe=6AC4FE57"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wQzgZsPbE98Q7kNvwHGWKgK&_nc_oc=Adr_OK7omPQEbZmsHrwoSBj45Vg5I9NpLKiz_OGR3i6qihWu3dy4eienXvp_zXueeEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP1EcaG0FRdM6M4UnngsHnoYCowgOwbo84I7yXOVB1r1A&oe=6AC4FC61"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qxbRrnZXfIIQ7kNvwHcR3dM&_nc_oc=Adr44izrBeq1zx1Hv0aj_7_N80uyM7fDkE7GVlxbs01YmctdHRtkWTas037RRvnpbwQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPll1vmiov_yzEz97u_XoN1YvLFkKt4T_f0LJrzuklBiw&oe=6AC522D7"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n76UKnDMTgoQ7kNvwHv3etf&_nc_oc=AdqBazErATDe8p41lOmeyy3OHWWK57AKxLnlGT4davRo8wtxgQPG-LLL6nqBVR4HFRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOebepZ_DHTtM9AgW6Dnz-6j0HnF8_6iPs9tHZnZ-Jf_Q&oe=6AC52962"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9fiZwLjynpAQ7kNvwFOL_Iq&_nc_oc=Ado8Krl1ZA_zDAtHHputBkKrWO15N3r4hSZGpiJSkd_3LCcC3AtOaxbL2_hpeX1tTgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFX7IRPUdI_ntotf7i73g1kb5-JDk0_H_JkZNuvizB0Q&oe=6AC515AE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null